# Whitelist: the image needs the locked project metadata, the package source and the
# exported production model. Everything else (data, registry, venv, tests, caches,
# .git, .claude) stays out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!build/model/

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
